@startuml
title Adaptive-linear ACL connection policy

skinparam monochrome true
hide empty description

[*] --> Disconnected

Disconnected --> Stable : managed ACL connected\ninitialize from effective interval
Stable --> Disconnected : managed ACL disconnected
Cooldown --> Disconnected : managed ACL disconnected
UpdatePending --> Disconnected : managed ACL disconnected

Stable --> Stable : not streaming / recovery tick\nno change
Stable --> Stable : stable streaming / recovery tick\nbefore minimum update period\nno change
Stable --> UpdatePending : underrun episode and cooldown elapsed\ntarget = min(maximum, effective + increase step)
Stable --> UpdatePending : stable streaming and recovery due\ntarget = max(minimum, effective - decrease step)

Cooldown --> Cooldown : underrun or recovery tick\nbefore minimum update period\ncoalesce desired target
Cooldown --> UpdatePending : minimum update period elapsed\nrequest coalesced target

UpdatePending --> Cooldown : Bluetooth request accepted locally\nwait for peer result
UpdatePending --> Stable : local request failed\nrecord platform error

Cooldown --> Stable : parameter update callback\nstore effective interval
Cooldown --> Stable : peer rejection or timeout\nretain previous effective interval

note right of UpdatePending
All arithmetic saturates at the configured bounds.
The requested value never replaces effective state until
the Bluetooth callback confirms the negotiated result.
end note

note bottom of Stable
Recovery is evaluated only while audio is streaming.
end note
@enduml
